  "body": "Direct-PR: ledger-note of #955 applied by hand by the docs steward (AGENTS.md §8)\nClaim: cloud/orch\nAuthor model: Opus 5.5 (cloud/orch)\nReviewer model: pending (Fable)\n\nThe `ledger-note` of #955 changes item 10 (\"Duo and wide layouts\") of `docs/migration/GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md`, which is prose rather than a table row:\n\n- **Before:** \"GAP-212, 214 and 216 are unchanged.\"\n- **After:** \"GAP-212 and 216 are unchanged; GAP-214 follows legacy since #431 (a landscape iPhone reads the topic full width).\"\n\n`fold.py --check`: ok.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGTbJ8LjeZ6VYEWrtJ)_",
